i/media/images/dw/20260617/1143885331049746432056342.jpeg/3cmh44pHQpFE45Pp8spc-w5Q-m2uueLvi2Iws4tiMLM\"/><figcaption>暴雨中女子被沖倒，惠州2名外賣騎手挺身而出救援免釀慘禍。（翻攝自Facebook/XH.NewsAgency）</figcaption></figure><p>影/黑煙吞沒整座工廠！「中國鞋都」鞋廠大火　員工逃上天台</p><p>【本文獲「中天新聞網」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-12T04:18:40.073404+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1565,"images":20,"source":"HK01 中國","fallback":"none"}}